{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le08ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "text": "Being a prompt and meticulous person, Jennifer was always very specific about any arrangements she made. She was never late for an appointment. Her husband Alex, on the other hand, was an easy-going fellow who was usually late.\n<br/><br/>\nOn one particular Tuesday, Jennifer and Alex decided to meet for lunch at twelve o'clock. Realizing that Alex was likely to forget, Jennifer reminded him to come on time. \"Be in front of the Central Bank at exactly twelve o'clock,\" Jennifer said. Smiling to himself, Alex wondered how he and Jennifer could have managed to stay happily married all these years.", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob02re2img02.jpg", "text": "Alex made a real effort to be on time for the lunch date, and he arrived at the bank at five minutes past twelve. He was relieved to see that Jennifer wasn't waiting for him. Evidently, she hadn't arrived yet. Alex waited at the assigned meeting place. He waited until half past twelve.<br/><br/>Eventually, he came to the conclusion that his wife could have arrived at the bank exactly on time, and then left. If this was the case, she hadn't waited for him for more than five minutes. Feeling very annoyed, Alex went straight home.", "id": 2, "time": "32000"}, {"image": "engenn11le08ob02re2img03.jpg", "text": "Upon arriving home, Alex wasn't surprised to see that Jennifer had already arrived. He flew into the house, and before Jennifer could say a word, Alex reproached her, telling her with annoyance in his voice: \"I waited for you for half an hour before I realized that you had come and gone. You must have left after five minutes. You could have waited a little longer.\" <br/>\nHis wife looked confused. \"What are you talking about, Alex?\" she said. \"Where did you wait? I was in front of the bank for at least half an hour.\" <br/><br/>\"That's impossible,\" Alex almost shouted. \"You couldn't have been there. I was in front of the Midland Bank at five past twelve, and in my book, five minutes late isn't late.\"<br/>\n\"Alex,\" Jennifer said calmly, \"you were there at the right time. The only trouble is that you were in the wrong place.\u201d", "id": 3, "time": "59000"}]}}], "_data": []}], "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about people's personalities, love and marriage.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express uncertainty about past events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about two actions together.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Can you remember the last time that you were late for something? What happened?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you think being punctual is overrated or underrated? Explain.", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's find out who made it to the appointment on time!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [